# Lingo Play — Comprehensive Pre-Publication Quality Assurance, Reliability, and Stability Audit

## 1. Purpose of This Request

My application, **Lingo Play**, is currently working extremely well.

I am very satisfied with its existing appearance, user experience, features, interactions, and overall performance.

Before publishing the application for public use, I want a comprehensive, professional quality assurance (QA) audit to ensure it is stable, reliable, secure, and ready for real users.

The purpose of this audit is NOT to redesign, improve, modernize, simplify, expand, or restructure the application.

The purpose is to identify genuine problems that might currently be hidden, including issues that could occur under unusual circumstances, on different browsers, with different media files, or after prolonged usage.

**My highest priority is preserving the application exactly as it currently looks and behaves.**

I want the same Lingo Play, with the same interface, features, controls, animations, layouts, and interactions.

Only genuine errors, bugs, vulnerabilities, reliability problems, or missing persistence behavior should be addressed.

Do not make changes simply because another implementation appears cleaner, newer, or more technically sophisticated.

